title: "Postal mail server performance: benchmark, bottlenecks and optimisation"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible Ansible load-testing bench for the Postal mail server, reference
  measurements of its throughput under different receiver policies and IP pool sizes,
  an analysis of its delivery queue, and an optimised Postal build.
